            "detailed_description": "The last title released for the tenth anniversary of the &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS&quot; series, &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4-II&quot;, is here at last! <br />\r\nNaomasa Ii appears as a playable character for the first time, and the various personalities of the age are explored in more depth in &quot;Story Mode&quot;, which is now focused on individual characters. <br />\r\nSeries favorite &quot;Survival Mode&quot; returns as well, powered up from its previous iterations. <br />\r\nThe most well-received elements of &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4&quot; are carried over, while the action balance, cut-scenes and character development systems have all been significantly upgraded. Explore the world of &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4&quot; anew, in this whole new take on the title!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* The images are from an in-development build and may differ from the final version.",
            "about_the_game": "The last title released for the tenth anniversary of the &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS&quot; series, &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4-II&quot;, is here at last! <br />\r\nNaomasa Ii appears as a playable character for the first time, and the various personalities of the age are explored in more depth in &quot;Story Mode&quot;, which is now focused on individual characters. <br />\r\nSeries favorite &quot;Survival Mode&quot; returns as well, powered up from its previous iterations. <br />\r\nThe most well-received elements of &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4&quot; are carried over, while the action balance, cut-scenes and character development systems have all been significantly upgraded. Explore the world of &quot;SAMURAI WARRIORS 4&quot; anew, in this whole new take on the title!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* The images are from an in-development build and may differ from the final version.",
